   <p></p><h1><span style="font-family: inherit;">Local Oral Health Programs</span><br/></h1><p>The California Healthcare, Research, and Prevention Tobacco Act of 2016 (Proposition 56) provides funding for 61 Local Health Jurisdictions (LHJs) to create and expand capacity at the local level to educate, prevent, and provide linkages to treatment programs. Grantees establish or expand upon existing programs by including the following activities related to oral health: education, disease prevention, community-clinical linkages, and surveillance. These local-level activities will improve the oral health of all Californians. </p><div><h2>Current Grant Initiative<br/></h2><p></p><p><a href="https://oralhealthsupport.ucsf.edu/moving-california-oral-health-forward-rfa-2022-2027" target="_blank">Moving California Oral Health Forward 2022-2027 Grant</a>&#160;<br/></p><p></p></div></div><div class="NewsItemContent"><h2>Related Publications<br/></h2><p><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/DCDIC/CDCB/CDPH%20Document%20Library/Oral%20Health%20Program/California_Partnership_for_Oral_Health_Plan_ADA_FINAL_6.15.2021.pdf" target="_blank">California Partnerships for Oral Health Plan</a> (2021) (PDF)<br/></p><p><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/DCDIC/CDCB/CDPH%20Document%20Library/Oral%20Health%20Program/OH%20Surveillance%20Plan%20-%20ADA%209.25.2019.pdf" target="_blank">California Oral Health Surveillance Plan 2019 - 2023</a>&#160;(PDF)<br/></p><p><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/DCDIC/CDCB/CDPH%20Document%20Library/Oral%20Health%20Program/FINAL%20REDESIGNED%20COHP-Oral-Health-Plan-ADA.pdf" target="_blank">California Oral Health Plan 2018 - 2028</a>&#160;(PDF)<br/></p><p><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/DCDIC/CDCB/CDPH%20Document%20Library/Oral%20Health%20Program/Status%20of%20Oral%20Health%20in%20California_FINAL_04.20.2017_ADA.pdf" target="_blank">The Oral Disease and Burden and Prevention 2017</a>&#160;(PDF)<span style="font-size: 1em;">&#160;&#160;</span></p><h2>Webinars &amp; Trainings</h2><h3>Fiscal Trainings<br/></h3><p><a href="https://oralhealthsupport.ucsf.edu/california-department-public-health-office-oral-health" target="_blank">March 23, 2021</a></p><p><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/DCDIC/CDCB/CDPH%20Document%20Library/Oral%20Health%20Program/LOHP%20Fiscal%20Training%20PowerPoint%20-%20ADA.pdf" target="_blank">February 22, 2019 (PDF)</a></p><h2>Evaluation 101</h2><p><a href="https://www.cdph.ca.gov/Programs/CCDPHP/DCDIC/CDCB/CDPH%20Document%20Library/Oral%20Health%20Program/Evaluation%20101-Final%20ADA.pdf" target="_blank">October 22, 2018 (PDF)</a></p><h2>Onboarding Resources for New LHJ Staff</h2><p><a href="https://oralhealthsupport.ucsf.edu/sites/g/files/tkssra861/f/wysiwyg/Onboarding%20Guide%201.3.23.pdf">Local Oral Health Program (LOHP) Resource Guide​</a>&#160;(PDF)<br/></p><p>&#160;</p></div> ​​</div><div class="ms-clear"></div></div>
